Z||000002||Scott||05-30-2001||04:21 PM||||I don't think so.  I have looked at 4 cyl. head compatibility in a few years, but I think they're quite alot different.  Talk to a GM mech. (call the local garage) or look it up in one the comparo books at the local salvage yard.  If I remeber correct, the '83-'85 motors are the same, but '86 & up are diff.  I've only worried 'bout the '84-'85 Dukes, which I know are compatible.  Good luck.||||reg||1
Z||000003||Indiana_resto_guy||05-30-2001||08:21 PM||||Nope won't work!<BR>84 thru 86 are the same, 87 & 88 are different!||||reg||1
